OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786673923
OL,3,CJump in house hunters seeking homes
OL,4,Cwith air conditioning as temperatures
OL,5,Csurge
OL,7,FSearches for homes for sale with air
OL,8,Fconditioning on a property website
OL,9,Fhave more than doubled over the late
OL,10,Fspring and summer months compared with
OL,11,Flast year.
OL,13,FRightmove said it saw a 104% uplift in
OL,14,Fsearches on its website between May 1
OL,15,Fand July 31 compared with the same
OL,16,Fperiod a year earlier.
OL,18,FColleen Babcock, a property expert at
OL,19,FRightmove, said: "This summer's
OL,20,Fheatwaves appear to be influencing how
OL,21,Fpeople think about their homes."
OL,26,@{D@ROU}D@`O]
