CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786673923
OL,3,CJump in house hunters seeking homes
OL,4,Cwith air conditioning as temperatures
OL,5,Csurge
OL,7,FMark Wiggin, director of Mark Wiggin
OL,8,FEstate Agents, said: "Energy
OL,9,Fefficiency and a home's ability to
OL,10,Fstay comfortable throughout the year
OL,11,Fhave become much more important
OL,12,Fconsiderations when people are
OL,13,Fdeciding where to live."
OL,15,FJames Waight, head of sales at John D
OL,16,FWood & Co said: "We are seeing buyers
OL,17,Fpay closer attention to air
OL,18,Fconditioning, ventilation and how well
OL,19,Fa home retains a comfortable
OL,20,Ftemperature during warmer months."
OL,26,@pD@VOUuD@XO]xD@QOU|D@bO]
