OL,3,CJump in house hunters seeking homes
OL,4,Cwith air conditioning as temperatures
OL,5,Csurge
OL,7,FIan Harris, president of NAEA
OL,8,F(National Association of Estate
OL,9,FAgents) Propertymark said: "Whilst air
OL,10,Fconditioning is clearly becoming a
OL,11,Fmore visible feature on buyers' wish
OL,12,Flists, agents are seeing a broader
OL,13,Fshift in what people want from a home:
OL,14,Fcomfort and liveability are
OL,15,Fincreasingly being considered
OL,16,Falongside traditional factors such as
OL,17,Flocation, space and price.
OL,26,@qD@\OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786673923
OL,3,CJump in house hunters seeking homes
OL,4,Cwith air conditioning as temperatures
OL,5,Csurge
OL,7,F"What is particularly interesting is
OL,8,Fthat buyers are becoming more alert to
OL,9,Fhow a property will perform in
OL,10,Fdifferent conditions, rather than
OL,11,Fsimply looking at individual features.
OL,13,F"Agents are increasingly fielding
OL,14,Fquestions about ventilation, natural
OL,15,Fshade, glazing, orientation and energy
OL,16,Fcosts, with buyers wanting to
OL,17,Funderstand what living in a property
OL,18,Fwill actually feel like throughout the
OL,19,Fyear.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786673923
OL,3,CJump in house hunters seeking homes
OL,4,Cwith air conditioning as temperatures
OL,5,Csurge
OL,7,F"This is an important change in buyer
OL,8,Fbehaviour. As hotter summers become
OL,9,Fmore familiar, the ability of a home
OL,10,Fto remain comfortable in warm weather
OL,11,Fis likely to become a more established
OL,12,Fconsideration during viewings and
OL,13,Fvaluations, rather than something
OL,14,Fbuyers only think about once they have
OL,15,Fmoved in."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@JO]
